              ],
              "excerptSha256": "5807c2ee18d7d56302ef1ebe48e5a0a742b1d258c035bc4997771ec3a5ef6368"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-head-tail-examples",
        "moduleId": "head-and-tail",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "取头取尾的教材算例",
        "markdown": "教材用取头尾操作展示分解过程：$GetHead(B)=e$，$GetTail(B)=()$；$GetHead(D)=A$，$GetTail(D)=(B,C)$。\n\n由于 $(B,C)$ 仍为非空列表，还可继续分解得到 $GetHead((B,C))=B$，$GetTail((B,C))=(C)$。",
